OL,3,GNEWSA'Suit spotted on Traitors' and
OL,4,A'air raid shelters found'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FSomerset Council outlined repair plans
OL,11,Ffor Burnham-On-Sea's historic Low
OL,12,FLighthouse amid fresh concerns about
OL,13,Fits condition.
OL,15,FFour abandoned air raid shelters were
OL,16,Fdiscovered under four schools in
OL,17,FBristol this week.
OL,19,FA man with additional needs who mistook
OL,20,FPrince William for Prince the pop star
OL,21,Fand asked him to sing "Purple Rain" has
OL,22,Fwritten to the royal to apologise.
